  "eggMessage": "&emsp;&emsp;Congratulations! You found the <strong>little easter egg</strong> hidden in Loftify.<br/>&emsp;&emsp;If you've found this, you probably know Loftify pretty well, so let me introduce myself. I returned to Flutter development to build Loftify and adapt it for tablets and Windows. My authenticator app was well received by my roommate, and even his colleagues asked about an iOS version. It was the first time I felt the joy of seeing my work recognized by others. In my spare time, I rebuilt CloudOTP in Flutter and added many new features. I hope to share more of my work with people who enjoy it in the future.<br/>&emsp;&emsp;Inspired by Android 14, this easter egg is dedicated to everyone who uses Loftify. I hope you enjoy it - and Loftify too. 💕💕",
